## BloodKnightKit — the kit of the Blood Knight (CourtEnemyData "blood_knight";
## Act VII, GDD §15.0 "Act VII foundation (phase 1)"): a soldier with a halberd
## and blood-red plate. A vampire (row "feeds" 0.5): it feeds on every hit, its
